        <activityName xml:lang="en">Distribution network, electricity, low voltage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Distribution network, electricity, low voltage
This data set reflects the Swiss electricity distribution grid on the low voltage level including underground cables, aerial lines and transformers in the year 2011;
UUID: 89ae5562-73eb-37ce-a835-2055cb7e9c7d
This data set includes the material use of the infrastructure for electricity distribution on the low voltage level.
Location: Data from Switzerland but also valid for Europe and North America
Technology: Electricity distribution infrastructure
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_89ae5562-73eb-37ce-a835-2055cb7e9c7d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
